  "notes": "Deliberately 'dumb' minimal budget app: one centered white container with soft shadow on #f5f5f5. Income/Expenses tiles have 3px colored left borders (green/red) and tiny funnel icons that toggle a type filter (active state gets a tinted circle). Amounts color-coded green/red; balance red when negative. Recurring expenses (seen live) get a blue left border, ↻ icon and '(Recurring)' tag. Edit modal reuses the add form with an 'Update' button and pill segmented Income/Expense switch; Recurring checkbox progressively discloses interval + unit select. Modal closes on backdrop click but not Escape. Export via CSV/PDF buttons; moon icon theme toggle (dark mode)."
